WEBVTT

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.525 line:72%
A photo of your cat comes up. Your hand reaches out first.

00:00:02.695 --> 00:00:04.495 line:72%
What if your cat were curled up in a corner of your desktop?

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:07.677 line:72%
This is Pawture, an open-source desktop companion for Mac.

00:00:07.847 --> 00:00:10.457 line:72%
Choose one clear photo showing your cat’s face and body.

00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:12.872 line:72%
While your cat sleeps, brush its back slowly with the pointer.

00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:14.852 line:72%
It might keep its eyes closed and give a little murmur.

00:00:14.942 --> 00:00:15.792 line:72%
[a soft murmur]

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:18.337 line:72%
Sometimes Mimi and Baobao come over to touch noses.

00:00:18.427 --> 00:00:19.927 line:72%
Sometimes they curl up and sleep together.

00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:21.747 line:72%
You don’t have to do anything. Just watch.

00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:24.897 line:72%
Sleepy or affectionate? You control the sliders.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.377 line:72%
A photo can’t give your cat its memories.

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.167 line:72%
You set those little traits the way you remember them.

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:32.147 line:72%
Cat in front of your document? Pick it up and drag it aside.

00:00:32.237 --> 00:00:33.057 line:72%
Then carry on with your work.

00:00:33.227 --> 00:00:34.767 line:72%
Maybe a digital afterlife for a pet

00:00:34.857 --> 00:00:36.727 line:72%
is giving it a place in a familiar day.
